{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117993","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117993/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117993/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117993/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117993","id":4168448089,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc74dXhZ","number":117993,"title":"Label3D Creating Two Children","user":{"login":"Laex05","id":46410141,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDEwMTQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46410141?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laex05","html_url":"https://github.com/Laex05","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laex05/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laex05/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laex05/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laex05/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laex05/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laex05/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laex05/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laex05/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laex05/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-30T07:58:29Z","updated_at":"2026-03-31T07:26:22Z","closed_at":"2026-03-30T18:45:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible In Godot 4.6\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - macOS Tahoe (26.3.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M2 Max - Apple M2 Max (12 threads) - 32.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n- Godot 4.6\n\nWhen creating a Label3D, it creates two children on the parent, which I have been unable to fix with any adjustments whether or not using call_deferred, etc.\n\nUsing C++\n\nLabel3D *label = Object::cast_to<Label3D>(create_node(parent, \"Label3D\"));\n\n  label->set_pixel_size(0.001);\n  label->set_font_size(size * 10);\n  label->set_outline_size(outline);\n  label->set_text(text);\n\n\nstatic Node3D *create_node(Node *parent, String type)\n{\n  SceneTree *tree = get_tree();\n\n  if (!tree)\n  {\n    return nullptr;\n  }\n\n  Node3D *node;\n\n  // Large if else tree\n  else if (type == \"Label3D\")\n  {\n    node = memnew(Label3D);\n  }\n\n  if (!parent)\n  {\n    parent = tree->get_root();\n  }\n\n  parent->call_deferred(\"add_child\", node);\n\n  uint64_t obj_id = node->get_instance_id();\n\n  node_id++;\n  nodes[node_id] = obj_id;\n\n  return node;\n}\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee above\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSee above","closed_by":{"login":"Laex05","id":46410141,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDEwMTQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46410141?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laex05","html_url":"https://github.com/Laex05","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laex05/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laex05/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laex05/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Laex05/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/us